# CODEOWNERS – https://docs.github.com/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# The @OWNER_* entries below are PLACEHOLDERS, not real accounts.
# Replace each one with real GitHub usernames (e.g. @alice) or a team
# (e.g. @org/team-name) before enabling "Require review from Code Owners":
#   @OWNER_APP       – application code (frontend + backend)
#   @OWNER_CI        – CI pipelines and security scanning
#   @OWNER_DELIVERY  – containers, nginx, delivery scripts
#   @OWNER_INFRA     – infrastructure as code and architecture docs
#   @OWNER_MONITOR   – monitoring / operational scripts
#
# Later rules take precedence over earlier ones, so the default is first.

# Default owner for anything not matched below
*                       @VE-Vaniya

# Application
/src/                   @OWNER_APP
/index.html             @OWNER_APP
/backend/               @OWNER_APP

# CI / security
/.github/workflows/     @OWNER_CI

# Containers / delivery
Dockerfile*             @OWNER_DELIVERY
docker-compose*         @OWNER_DELIVERY
/nginx/                 @OWNER_DELIVERY

# Infrastructure
/infra/                 @OWNER_INFRA
/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md   @OWNER_INFRA

# Delivery + monitoring scripts
/scripts/               @OWNER_DELIVERY @OWNER_MONITOR
